# Only protected paths need a human review. Agent PRs that touch just src/, tests/, docs/
# can therefore auto-merge once required checks pass. Do NOT add a catch-all `*` line, and
# do not own docs/design/ or docs/prds/ paths that agents write (it would block auto-merge).
/.github/        @phch
/.claude/        @phch
/scripts/        @phch
/evals/          @phch
/web/            @phch
/Makefile        @phch
/pyproject.toml  @phch
/uv.lock         @phch
/CLAUDE.md       @phch
